# Lattice ECP5-25k constraints for the adaptive FPGA denoiser.
# Package: CABGA381
#
# This is a minimal timing-closure constraint file.  No I/O pin assignments
# are made here because the top-level module exposes the denoiser's streaming
# interface and not the physical pins of any specific development board.
# Add board-specific pin assignments (LOCATE COMP ... SITE "...", IO_TYPE ...)
# for the ULX3S or other ECP5 boards here when wiring to real peripherals.

FREQUENCY NET "clk" 100.0 MHz;
